  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Unique natural-language interface to the BioModels database — the authoritative repository for curated mathematical models in biology. Bridges quantitative pharmacology and LLM-based reasoning, enabling non-programmer researchers to query and simulate published QSP models. MIT licence, backed by EMBL-EBI, published in BMC Bioinformatics 2025. 83 stars, early-stage adoption. Assess for teams building drug-discovery or pharmacokinetics pipelines who need LLM access to systems biology knowledge.",
